{"id":"wb-7-1734","name":"浙江大学龙泉分校旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"浙江大学龙泉分校旧址","text":"浙江大学龙泉分校旧址位于浙江省丽水市龙泉市。旧址建筑面北向，中西合壁式建筑，建筑面积2293.5平方米。建筑立面为典型为巴洛克风格。建筑平面分三条轴线：中轴线上为两进两天井，并设厢房；东、西两轴线各有厢房七间，均为二层单檐。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B5%99%E6%B1%9F%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E9%BE%99%E6%B3%89%E5%88%86%E6%A0%A1%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":84936026,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84936026","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/05ae864564585652a3e58620.jpg","title":"浙大龙泉分校旧址,_2022-09-29_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B5%99%E5%A4%A7%E9%BE%99%E6%B3%89%E5%88%86%E6%A0%A1%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80,_2022-09-29_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/%E6%B5%99%E5%A4%A7%E9%BE%99%E6%B3%89%E5%88%86%E6%A0%A1%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80%2C_2022-09-29_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​浙大龙泉分校旧址","width":320,"height":214}}